{"text": "Okay, so I need to make 24 using the numbers 1, 7, 10, and 13.", "start": 0, "end": 62, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Each number has to be used exactly once, and I can use addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division.", "start": 63, "end": 170, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Hmm, let's see.", "start": 171, "end": 186, "label": "stalling"}
{"text": "First, I should recall that 24 can be factored in several ways.", "start": 188, "end": 251, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Like 24 is 4*6, 3*8, 12*2, 24*1, etc.", "start": 252, "end": 289, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Maybe if I can find a way to get those intermediate numbers using the given numbers.", "start": 290, "end": 374, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's list out the numbers again: 1, 7, 10, 13.", "start": 375, "end": 422, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let me try combining some numbers.", "start": 424, "end": 458, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's see, 13 is the largest number here.", "start": 459, "end": 500, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "If I subtract something from 13, maybe.", "start": 501, "end": 540, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "13 - 7 = 6.", "start": 541, "end": 552, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Then if I can get 4 from 1 and 10, but 10 -1 is 9, which doesn't help.", "start": 553, "end": 623, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "10 +1 is 11.", "start": 624, "end": 636, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Hmm.", "start": 637, "end": 641, "label": "stalling"}
{"text": "Alternatively, 13 -10 =3, then 7 -1=6, 3*6=18, which is not 24.", "start": 642, "end": 705, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Wait, maybe multiplication.", "start": 707, "end": 734, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's see, 13 +7=20, then 10 +1=11, but 20 +11=31, which is over.", "start": 735, "end": 800, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "13*1=13, then 10 +7=17, 13 +17=30.", "start": 801, "end": 835, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Still over.", "start": 836, "end": 847, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "What if I do 13 -1=12, then 10 -7=3, 12*3=36.", "start": 849, "end": 894, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Not 24.", "start": 895, "end": 902, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Hmm.", "start": 903, "end": 907, "label": "stalling"}
