{"text": "Let's see.", "start": 924, "end": 934, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "If I can divide to get a fraction that might multiply into 24.", "start": 935, "end": 997, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "For example, 13 - (10 / (7 -1))?", "start": -1, "end": -1, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's compute that.", "start": 1236, "end": 1255, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "7-1=6, 10/6=1.666, 13 -1.666=11.333.", "start": -1, "end": -1, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Not helpful.", "start": 1291, "end": 1303, "label": "inform"}
